[l_braz_por]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Infiltrar administração civil
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=O governo [From.GetAdjective] possui vários pontos fracos onde podemos infiltrar um agente em suas operações. Fazer isso nos traria conhecimento valioso sobre o funcionamento interno de [From.getAdjective], além de nos fornecer a oportunidade de usar esse agente em futuras operações contra [From.GetNameDef].

[l_english]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Infiltrate Civilian Administration
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§LThe [From.GetAdjective] government has numerous weakpoints through which we might infiltrate an agent into its operations. Doing so would give us valuable insight into the internal workings of [From.GetNameDef] as well as giving us an opportunity to utilize this agent in future operations against [From.GetNameDef].§!

[l_french]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Infiltrer l'administration
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§LL'administration [From.GetAdjFS] pourrait assez aisément être infiltrée par un agent opérationnel.\n   Cela nous permettrait d'obtenir des informations de grande valeur sur les opérations en cours et nous offrirait l'occasion d'utiliser cet agent pour les opérations futures contre [From.GetLeLaLNP] [From.GetName].§!

[l_german]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Zivile Verwaltung infiltrieren
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§LDie [From.GetAdjective]e Regierung hat einige Schwachstellen, die wir nutzen könnten, um einen Agenten einzuschleusen. Das würde uns wertvolle Einblicke in die [From.getAdjective]e Verwaltung liefern. Außerdem könnten wir den Agenten für zukünftige Operationen gegen [From.GetName] nutzen.§!

[l_japanese]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=市民行政府への潜入
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]政府には諜報員が作戦で浸透できそうな弱点が無数に存在している。政府に浸透することで、[From.GetNameDef]内部の事情について有益な見識を得るのみならず、浸透させた諜報員を[From.GetNameDef]に対する将来的な作戦に利用する機会をももたらすだろう。§!

[l_korean]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=민간 행정에 잠입
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective] 정부에는 공작원을 침투시킬 수 있는 취약점이 여럿 존재합니다. 이를 통해 [From.GetNameDef]의 내부 사정에 대한 귀중한 정보를 얻을 수 있을 뿐 아니라, 이후 [From.GetNameDef](을)를 상대로 한 작전에 이 공작원을 활용할 기회도 생길 것입니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Przeniknięcie do administracji cywilnej
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=Rząd [From.GetAdjective] ma wiele słabych punktów, dzięki którym możemy zainstalować w nim naszego agenta. Dzięki temu uzyskamy cenne informacje o tym, co dzieje się wewnątrz [From.getAdjective], a nasz agent będzie mógł wspierać nasze kolejne operacje, których celem będzie [From.GetNameDef].

[l_russian]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Внедрение в правительство
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§LУ [From.GetAdjRuLower]ого правительства множество уязвимых мест, через которые мы можем внедрить своего агента. В таком случае мы будем получать ценные сведения о внутренних процессах [From.GetNameDef] государства, а также сможем в будущем использовать этого агента в операциях против [From.GetNameRuGen].§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=渗透民政管理机构
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]政府漏洞百出，也许我们可以利用这一点派出特工打入他们的组织内部。这样做将使我们获得有关[From.GetNameDef]内部工作的宝贵信息，同时也能让这名特工在未来的抵抗[From.GetNameDef]的行动中为我们所用。§!

[l_spanish]
operation_infiltrate_civilian=Infiltrarse en administración civil
operation_infiltrate_civilian_desc=El gobierno [From.GetAdjective] tiene varios puntos débiles que nos permitirían infiltrar a un agente en sus operaciones. Esto nos brindaría información valiosa sobre los trabajos internos [From.getAdjective], así como la oportunidad de usar a este agente en futuras operaciones contra [From.GetNameDef].
